# Convenience renders of tracked .tex tables (regenerable; duplicates tracked content)
reports/tables/rendered/

# Results-chapter working area: the .tex source and its verification script ARE tracked
# (they are work product and the provenance of every number in the chapter). These are not:
#   - the preview PDF, a build artifact
#   - `tables`, a symlink to an absolute path in the dissertation repo, meaningless to anyone
#     else. It exists so standalone.tex can resolve \input{tables/...} while previewing;
#     recreate it locally with:
#       ln -s "<path>/Idrus_Fardeen_MSc_Dissertation/tables" reports/results_chapter/tables
reports/results_chapter/*.pdf
reports/results_chapter/tables
reports/results_chapter/*.aux
reports/results_chapter/*.bbl
reports/results_chapter/*.bcf
reports/results_chapter/*.blg
reports/results_chapter/*.run.xml
reports/results_chapter/*.toc
reports/results_pack/
